   Bergeron, Augustin, Harvard Univ, Dept Econ, Cambridge, MA USA.
   Tourek, Gabriel, Univ Calif Davis, Dept Econ, Davis, CA USA.
   Weigel, Jonathan L., Univ Calif Berkeley, Haas Sch Business, Berkeley, CA USA.},
